<p>Dear Dr. Wang,</p>

<p>On behalf of the Program Committee, I am pleased to inform you that your paper <b>"Layered Timeout Fallback in Email Gateways: A Practical Approach to Graceful Degradation"</b> (Paper #114) has been <b style="color:#0a7d34">accepted</b> for presentation at ACM CCS 2026.</p>

<p>Your paper received the following review scores: <b>Accept (4.5/5)</b>, <b>Weak Accept (3.5/5)</b>, <b>Accept (4.0/5)</b>. The meta-review highlights "the practical evaluation on a real production email gateway with over 2M daily messages" as a significant strength.</p>

